000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. VREC.
000300* Variable-length records: two record descriptions of different
000400* lengths under one FD make the file RECFM=V; WRITE writes the
000500* length of the description named; records come back with their
000600* own lengths, the area beyond a short one untouched; a REWRITE in
000700* update mode keeps the record's length. Blocked three to a block.
000800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001000 FILE-CONTROL.
001100     SELECT VOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-VRECF.
001200     SELECT VUPD ASSIGN TO UT-S-VRECF.
001300     SELECT VIN  ASSIGN TO UT-S-VRECF.
001400 DATA DIVISION.
001500 FILE SECTION.
001600 FD  VOUT
001700     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001800     BLOCK CONTAINS 3 RECORDS
001900     RECORD CONTAINS 10 TO 40 CHARACTERS.
002000 01  VO-SHORT.
002100     05  VOS-KEY  PIC X(4).
002200     05  VOS-TEXT PIC X(6).
002300 01  VO-LONG.
002400     05  VOL-KEY  PIC X(4).
002500     05  VOL-TEXT PIC X(36).
002600 FD  VUPD
002700     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
002800     BLOCK CONTAINS 3 RECORDS
002900     RECORDING MODE IS V.
003000 01  VU-SHORT.
003100     05  VUS-KEY  PIC X(4).
003200     05  VUS-TEXT PIC X(6).
003300 01  VU-LONG.
003400     05  VUL-KEY  PIC X(4).
003500     05  VUL-TEXT PIC X(36).
003600 FD  VIN
003700     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
003800     BLOCK CONTAINS 3 RECORDS.
003900 01  VI-SHORT.
004000     05  VIS-KEY  PIC X(4).
004100     05  VIS-TEXT PIC X(6).
004200 01  VI-LONG.
004300     05  VIL-KEY  PIC X(4).
004400     05  VIL-TEXT PIC X(36).
004500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004600 01  WS-EOF   PIC X VALUE 'N'.
004700 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
004800 MAIN-PARA.
004900     OPEN OUTPUT VOUT.
005000     MOVE 'L001' TO VOL-KEY.
005100     MOVE 'first long record, thirty-six chars.' TO VOL-TEXT.
005200     WRITE VO-LONG.
005300     MOVE 'S002' TO VOS-KEY.  MOVE 'short2' TO VOS-TEXT.
005400     WRITE VO-SHORT.
005500     MOVE 'L003' TO VOL-KEY.
005600     MOVE 'third long record, also thirty-six.' TO VOL-TEXT.
005700     WRITE VO-LONG.
005800     MOVE 'S004' TO VOS-KEY.  MOVE 'short4' TO VOS-TEXT.
005900     WRITE VO-SHORT.
006000     MOVE 'S005' TO VOS-KEY.  MOVE 'short5' TO VOS-TEXT.
006100     WRITE VO-SHORT.
006200     CLOSE VOUT.
006300     DISPLAY 'WRITTEN 5'.
006400     PERFORM READ-ALL.
006500     OPEN I-O VUPD.
006600     READ VUPD AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF.
006700     READ VUPD AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF.
006800     MOVE 'SHORT2' TO VUS-TEXT.
006900     REWRITE VU-SHORT.
007000     READ VUPD AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF.
007100     MOVE 'THIRD LONG RECORD, REWRITTEN IN PLACE' TO VUL-TEXT.
007200     REWRITE VU-LONG.
007300     CLOSE VUPD.
007400     DISPLAY 'REWRITTEN 2'.
007500     PERFORM READ-ALL.
007600     STOP RUN.
007700 READ-ALL.
007800     OPEN INPUT VIN.
007900     MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF.
008000     MOVE SPACES TO VI-LONG.
008100     PERFORM READ-ONE UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'.
008200     CLOSE VIN.
008300 READ-ONE.
008400     READ VIN AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF.
008500     IF WS-EOF NOT = 'Y'
008600         DISPLAY VIL-KEY ' [' VIL-TEXT ']'.
